ical study of psychiatric disorders in Kashan</article-title><source>Andisheh va Raftar</source><year>1996</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>19</fpage><lpage>27</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B11"><mixed-citation publication-type="book"><name><surname>Kavian</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Mossavi</surname><given-names>AS</given-names></name><name><surname>Mohit</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><source>Principal reliance in psychological interviews and tests</source><year>2000</year><edition>1</edition><publisher-name>Tehran: Sena</publisher-name><fpage>179</fpage><lpage>180</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B12"><mixed-citation publication-type="book"><name><surname>Wingo</surname><given-names>PA</given-names></name><name><surname>Higgins</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name><name><surname>Rubin</surname><given-names>GL</given-names></name><source>An epidemiologic approach to reproduction health</source><year>1994</year><publisher-name>Geneva: WHO</publisher-name><fpage>209</fpage><lpage>211</lpage></mixed-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>